  "description": "Build your ultimate 26” hardtail dirt jumper with the Fireball frame. Ideal for dirt jump parks, pump tracks, and slope style courses, this lightweight 6061 aluminum frame is the exact model ridden by Mongoose MTB pros Greg Watts and Brayden Barrett-Hay. With its modern DJ geometry, tapered headtube, internal cable routing, and forged 10mm dropouts (135mm spacing), the Fireball frame is the perfect canvas to design your dream DJ bike.\nBuild your ultimate 26” hardtail dirt jumper with a Fireball frame. Ideal to construct the perfect bike for the dirt jump park or pump track. Recommended for riders 5’3” or taller\nHigh-quality, lightweight 6061 aluminum alloy tubing with internal cable routing and modern DJ geometry designed to get airborne\nTapered headtube fits your fork of choice while horizontal forged 10mm dropouts with 135mm spacing make it compatible with your favorite set of wheels\n23” top tube length and frame weight of 4.5 lbs. Designed to fit 26” wheels",
